The key of master thievery is a decent choice for Chaotics.  It's light
and grants half physical.  It also grants TC and warning but a wiz
doesn't need that for long.  An AC challenged wizard should think about
getting the key, even though it doesn't grant MR.  It's the equivalent
of a lot of EA scrolls.



